  - Leave one side of the screen to come in on the other
  - Blue platforms move, red springs launch you
  <Objective>k__BackingField: Climb the highest.
  <Danger>k__BackingField: Falling off the bottom of the screen ends the run.
  <Scoring>k__BackingField: Height of your best run; everyone gets the same platforms.
